OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year-old man, from nearby
OL,7,FTarrawingee, was detained at the scene
OL,8,Fby a passer-by before being taken into
OL,9,Fcustody
OL,11,FPolice say it was an 'isolated
OL,12,Fincident' and they are working to
OL,13,Fidentify potential charges
